history.body:
The Hertz adapter was at 19.4% coverage (no hertzContext method, group,
wrapMiddleware, NoRoute/NoMethod or Run test) and the llmclient tracing
constructors were untested. Earlier commits on this branch added the
tests tied to each fix (Run bind error and lifecycle, Shutdown drain and
timeout, recovery, audit line, health, request ID, 405). This commit adds
in-memory engine tests for the rest:

- GET/POST/PUT/DELETE routing with Param, Query, GetHeader and GetBody;
- nested groups and middleware order (global > group > subgroup >
  handler and back) for every group method;
- Reply envelope JSON (message, data, metadata);
- BindJSON success and ERR_CLIENT_BAD_REQUEST on malformed JSON;
- Redirect and SetHeader;
- New uses the default options;
- llmclient: NewWithInstrumenter opens an "llm.<model>" span that parents
  the HTTP call, nil instrumenter returns the plain client, New and
  WrapWithTracing wrap, llmSpanName table.

Coverage with -short: httpserver/hertz 94.6%, llmclient 96.7%.

Item: R-122
Findings: C2-020

